1
00:00:00,300 --> 00:00:02,100
Most agents help you do more.

2
00:00:02,100 --> 00:00:04,000
Fewer helps you do less.

3
00:00:04,100 --> 00:00:05,100
On purpose.

4
00:00:05,200 --> 00:00:07,200
It has its own inbox,

5
00:00:07,300 --> 00:00:10,300
or I can paste on the Desk.

6
00:00:10,700 --> 00:00:13,200
Four asks: an invite, a coffee,

7
00:00:13,300 --> 00:00:15,000
a panel, a hijack attempt.

8
00:00:15,200 --> 00:00:18,000
It weighs them against
my three goals,

9
00:00:18,100 --> 00:00:19,600
checks who's asking,

10
00:00:19,700 --> 00:00:21,300
and plain rules decide:

11
00:00:21,400 --> 00:00:23,300
yes, smaller, ask one, blocked.

12
00:00:23,400 --> 00:00:26,400
One summary email,
one single-use code.

13
00:00:26,500 --> 00:00:27,900
I approve once;

14
00:00:28,000 --> 00:00:29,900
each reply goes out exactly once.
